			"Message": "feat(Common): Add Identifier field to SourceControlManagementProviderDTO\n\nAdd a new `Identifier` field to the SourceControlManagementProviderDTO struct to support provider identification (\"git\", \"github\", \"hg\", etc.). This field maps to the `scmId` in the `sky://scm/register` event payload, enabling Cocoon's `ScmShimRegistry` to properly re-emit events during Sky boot race conditions when late listeners register.\n\nThe field defaults to empty for backwards compatibility with existing DTOs.",
